                \-equivariance:
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modular+equivariant+elliptic+cohomology"} modular equivariant elliptic cohomology
          %h2#multiplicative_equivariant_cohomology Multiplicative equivariant cohomology
          %p
            For
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/multiplicative+cohomology+theories"} multiplicative cohomology theories
            there is a further refinement of equivariance where the equivariant cohomology groups are built from global sections on a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sheaf"} sheaf
            over cerain systems of
            = succeed "." do
